# k.attributes/shards/things-uses: what 75 common things of the catalog that do nothing by themselves and had no use are for (85 values; 16 of 101 proposed (15.8 %) were wrong by the hand check and are not written): the instrument role of k.actions, and uses inherited down WordNet's hypernyms from the kinds the catalog describes (KR6; the rule in tools/attributes-uses.mjs)
# sources: wordnet 3.1 (the hypernym chains of the first noun senses, as imported in k.words; the uses they carry down are the catalog's own: k.attributes, k.actions; hand-checked in sources/coverage/uses-audit.tsv)
# license: WordNet-3.0
# script: tools/attributes-uses.mjs

